ument made from  wood  cowhorn  cow and the mastic-like clarinet  we we need to take  reeds  like clarinet  and that's all  it's verbena  national instrument  david garingas was able to study at the  moscow state conservatory in the soviet  union  still he's happy that nowadays young  lithuanian musicians have more  opportunities open to them  now everyone learns everywhere  since the berlin wall fell everything  has opened up  now the students don't just study in  lithuania moscow or saint petersburg  they study in berlin cologne london  paris and the us  and that brings with it a great variety  of influences  the sounds of lithuania resonate at the  german finance ministry  other countries will also make guest  appearances here in december it's  luxembourg's turn
 

